“Madhav E-commerce Dashboard”,

Overview 

This project presents an interactive Power BI dashboard built to analyze sales data from Madhav E-commerce. It provides insights into business performance, customer trends, and product-level analysis to support data-driven decision-making.

🔹 Business Problem 

The business needs to understand sales performance, identify top-selling products, and analyze customer purchasing patterns to improve revenue and optimize decision-making.

🔹 Key KPIs
*Total Sales
*Total Profit
*Number of Orders
*Average Order Value
*Top Categories / Products

🔹 Key Insights (VERY IMPORTANT)

👉 Don’t leave this empty—this is what makes you stand out:

Example:

*Electronics category generates the highest revenue
*Majority of sales come from repeat customers
*Certain regions outperform others in sales
*Sales peak during specific months (seasonal trend)

🔹 Tools Used
*Power BI
*DAX
*Excel / CSV


🔹 Why This Project Matters

This dashboard helps businesses quickly monitor performance, identify trends, and make informed decisions using real-time data visualization.
